<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Horizon/CMS long-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Horizon/CMS long-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Thursday it raised its rating on Horizon/CMS Healthcare Corp to long-term buy from accumulate.  Merrill kept the near-term rating at neutral.</p>
</text>
